{"id":"rules","name":"官方规则 8 条 + 刷新规则（desc_info_data_chs）","kind":"规则","desc":"1.1、神秘商店改版后重新回归了！全新神秘商店的商品\"更丰富\"，且每一件商品都享有折扣，别再错过了。 ｜ 2.2、新增特权 ｜ 3.升级咯！：买的越多，商品越好！每次升级商店都会提升商品评级且赠送大量刷新币。 ｜ 4.高端购物：限时商品的概率提升，不再错过那些风靡一时的限时畅销商品。 ｜ 5.值得等待：额外帮您保存上一轮刷到的所有商品，随时可以回购；注意，系统免费刷新会强制刷走上一轮的商品哦。 ｜ 6.3、消耗一定信用点可使商店升级。每次升级后，下一次刷新开始整体商品评级会提升，同时会赠送一定的刷新币（具体见“说明”）。商店等级每期结束后重置（跨期不继承）。 ｜ 7.4、每消耗1个刷新币，可以对商品进行一次刷新。刷新币在活动结束后会清除。 ｜ 8.5、系统会在每周一和周五的0点额外刷新一次商店。 ｜ 刷新规则：商品池会在每周一、周五以及当期活动开始时分别自动刷新一次。刷新后新的记录会被保存，上一轮的数据（如有）会被清除。刷新时间可能有一定延迟，请见谅。","evidence":"structure","evidence_level":"static/candidate","status_tags":["static config","unverified"],"source":"11-12 PE script.py314.lc.npk · desc_info_data key=2637-2638","provenance":{"source_id":"pe-client-script-npk-20261112","source_lock_sha256":"f93ff230742802c5556aad9aabf028728ebcb448da9cc33c6c7f9afea5c10029","table":"desc_info_data","row_key":"2637-2638","field_refs":["version_desc"],"name_source":"desc_info_data_chs.py 中文槽位（desc_catalog 已发布值）","upstream":{"package_sha256":"f93ff230742802c5556aad9aabf028728ebcb448da9cc33c6c7f9afea5c10029","role":"PE-hotfix-20261112"},"locator_chain":{"chain_status":"replayed-structural","scope":"record","no_cross_source_field_join":true,"steps":[{"kind":"decoded-table-row","source_id":"pe-client-script-npk-20261112","table":"desc_info_data","row_key":"2637-2638","field_refs":["version_desc"]}]}},"rules":8,"desc_ids":[2637,2638,2677]},
{"id":"privileges","name":"5 个商店特权 / 6 级评级权重","kind":"机制","desc":"特权：升级咯！（买的越多，商品越好！）；高端购物（限时热销品返场来袭）；值得等待（记录保存，不再犹豫！）；精挑细选（请挑选你的心愿商品）；常客优惠（欢迎您再次光临） ｜ 等级权重（原值，未归一化）：Lv1 消耗— / A20 / B80 / S—；Lv2 消耗500 / A30 / B70 / S—；Lv3 消耗1000 / A35 / B55 / S10；Lv4 消耗2000 / A40 / B45 / S15；Lv5 消耗4000 / A45 / B35 / S20；Lv6 消耗7000 / A45 / B25 / S30 ｜ 商店等级每期结束重置、跨期不继承。刷新币与折扣数值未随客户端下发，不猜。","evidence":"structure","evidence_level":"static/candidate","status_tags":["static config","unverified"],"source":"11-12 PE script.py314.lc.npk · secret_fashion_privilege_data key=1-5","provenance":{"source_id":"pe-client-script-npk-20261112","source_lock_sha256":"f93ff230742802c5556aad9aabf028728ebcb448da9cc33c6c7f9afea5c10029","table":"secret_fashion_privilege_data","row_key":"1-5","field_refs":["name","sub_title","desc"],"name_source":"secret_fashion_privilege_data / group_weight_data 中文槽位与数值字段","upstream":{"package_sha256":"f93ff230742802c5556aad9aabf028728ebcb448da9cc33c6c7f9afea5c10029","role":"PE-hotfix-20261112"},"locator_chain":{"chain_status":"replayed-structural","scope":"record","no_cross_source_field_join":true,"steps":[{"kind":"decoded-table-row","source_id":"pe-client-script-npk-20261112","table":"secret_fashion_privilege_data","row_key":"1-5","field_refs":["name","sub_title","desc"]}]}},"privilege_count":5,"level_count":6},
